1
00:00:00,495 --> 00:00:02,527
As Uke comes to strike the side of the head

2
00:00:02,528 --> 00:00:05,146
step in deeply to his front 
turning at the same time 

3
00:00:05,147 --> 00:00:07,287
continuing the strike around in front of you

4
00:00:07,688 --> 00:00:10,236
as you step in underneath 
take control of the knife

5
00:00:10,237 --> 00:00:13,069
and throw down in front of you 
completing the Shiho-nage.

